# React Bits on the HUD

- Source: `frontend/src/components/react-bits/` (vendored). Do not npm-install a full React Bits theme.
- Accents only — never replace OrchestratorShell with a demo layout.
- All bits need `"use client"`.

## Placement map

| Component | Use for | Avoid |
| --------- | ------- | ----- |
| SpotlightCard | Boards, weather, task cards | Putting `overflow-y-auto` on the outer card |
| GlareHover | Task card hover sheen | Nesting heavy WebGL inside |
| GradientText | Tiny HUD labels (Suggested, footer) | Long body copy |
| BlurText | Center voice line | Dense tables |
| ClickSpark | Desk-wide click feedback | Extra wrappers that break layout |
| ElectricBorder | HITL modal only | Every card |
| Particles / LightRays | JarvisCore orb only (`ssr: false`) | Full-page backgrounds |
| Magnet | Rare micro-attract | CommandBaton / centering parents |

## Hard layout rules

- Scrollable SpotlightCard: max-height + `overflow-y-auto` on **`bodyClassName`**; outer stays viewport-locked for the glow.
- Flex columns with scrollable children: pin chips (`WeatherCard`) with **`shrink-0`**.
- Idle suggested tasks: title + description only; expand actions on hover/focus.

When adding a bit, read skill `jarvis-react-bits` and match existing props/colors (`#7dffe0` accent).
